// Title: Service Started/Stopped Via Wmic.EXE
// ID: 0b7163dc-7eee-4960-af17-c0cd517f92da
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-06-20
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1047
// Description: Detects usage of wmic to start or stop a service
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS " service ") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS " call ")) AND (where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "stopservice") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "startservice"))) AND ((where(OriginalFileName = "wmic.exe")) OR (where(Image IENDSWITH "\\WMIC.exe"))))
